rong style=\"line-height: 1;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong></span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, 돋움, Dotum, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><strong style=\"line-height: 1;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</strong></span><a href=\"https://biskit.kumoh.ac.kr/index.do\" style=\"color: inherit; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: 돋움; font-size: 16px;\">금오공과대학교 학생역량관리시스템 (kumoh.ac.kr)</a></p><p style=\"margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, 돋움, Dotum, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">심리검사 해석특강 날짜를 확인하시고 신청해주세요!!!</span><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><strong style=\"line-height: 1;\"><br></strong></span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, 돋움, Dotum, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><strong style=\"line-height: 1;\">-검사실시 : 신청자에게 개별 금오톡톡 or 카카오톡&nbsp;발송- 온라인으로 검사 실시</strong></span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, 돋움, Dotum, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><strong style=\"line-height: 1;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;*해석특강 2일 전까지 심리검사 실시 완료되어야 해석특강에 참여하실 수 있습니다.&nbsp;</strong></span></p><p style=\"margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 1em; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, 돋움, Dotum, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(102, 102, 102); word-break: break-all;\">